<title>GERMANY: BUBA SAYS NOV ADJUSTED JOBLESS RATE 10.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>BUBA SAYS NOV ADJUSTED JOBLESS RATE 10.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the</p>
<p>following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct)</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Nov 96    Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p> Rate				 10.7	 10.6	 9.7</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				  9.5	  9.4	 8.5</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				 15.8	 15.5	14.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk</p>
<p>of the jobless figures. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
